# Commandes PowerShell directes

## Groupes + tous leurs membres

```powershell
Get-ADGroup -Filter {Name -like "GG_F_CDAD-BDX*"} | ForEach-Object { 
    Write-Host "`n=== $($_.Name) ===" -ForegroundColor Cyan
    Get-ADGroupMember -Identity $_ -Recursive | 
    Where-Object {$_.objectClass -eq "user"} | 
    Select-Object Name, SamAccountName | 
    Format-Table -AutoSize 
}
```

---

## Utilisateur + tous ses groupes GG_F_CDAD-BDX

```powershell
Get-ADUser -Filter * -Properties MemberOf, DisplayName | ForEach-Object {
    $groupes = $_.MemberOf | ForEach-Object { Get-ADGroup $_ } | 
    Where-Object { $_.Name -like "GG_F_CDAD-BDX*" }
    if ($groupes) {
        Write-Host "`n=== $($_.DisplayName) ===" -ForegroundColor Yellow
        $groupes | Select-Object Name | Format-Table -AutoSize
    }
}
```

